<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine govt securities secondary market rates.</title>
<headline>Philippine govt securities secondary market rates.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are secondary market rates quoted by banks on Wednesday for Philippine government securities. The rates are indicative as maturities are slightly varying.</p>
<p>			     ---------------</p>
<p>  BANK		     RATES BID/OFFER PCT</p>
<p>			    3-mths	   6-mths	   1-year</p>
<p>Bank of America	10.70 /10.60  11.10 /10.90   11.70 /11.50</p>
<p>BPI			10.90 /10.775 11.25 /11.05   11.75 /11.55</p>
<p>Citibank		 10.875/10.75  11.25 /11.00   11.875/11.625</p>
<p>Hongkong Bank	  11.00 /10.85  11.30 /11.10   11.70 /11.55</p>
<p>Multinational	  10.825/10.70  11.125/11.00   11.60 /11.50</p>
<p>Solidbank		10.85 /10.75  11.125/11.05   11.60 /11.50</p>
<p>Standard Chartered   10.95 /10.75  11.25 /11.05   11.75 /11.55</p>
<p>			     ---------------</p>
<p>* To contribute to this page, please fax your quotes to Reuters Manila newsroom on (632) 817 6267. For details, please phone (632) 841 8937</p>
